{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟已將全新設計的Windows 11「運行」對話框推送至Release Preview預覽頻道，適用於Windows 11 25H2和26H2。對應版本為26200.10066和26300.10066，功能採取分批開放；預計本月稍晚先作為可選更新提供，並隨12月8日的「補丁星期二」更新向普通用户廣泛推出。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586352.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.980006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:40:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"4ff2431bce467c241b37272b32185953071972f4fa630cb1f7ed53a80e0afda7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}